    "updated_at": "2019-08-20T08:19:40Z",
    "body": "Well that's curious.\r\n\r\nI've checked and there are definitely no CRLF characters in the version in my git repo. `yay` also builds it fine on my Arch machine. I can only assume that CRLF characters are somehow being added between the AUR and `yay` on your machine.\r\n\r\nIs is possible this is some interaction between `yay` and the WSL? Can you manually download the `PKGBUILD` and build it, or does `makepkg` still complain about CRLFs in that version?\r\n\r\n\r\n",
