    "updated_at": "2019-08-20T08:45:37Z",
    "body": "I'm sorry, it was my mistake.\r\n\r\nThere was a tradeoff with Windows, so I tried to install it with` git config --global core.autocrlf = true` set.\r\nNow I solve it by setting `git config --global core.autocrlf = false`.\r\n\r\nSince I can speak only Japanese, I use Google Translate. I'm sorry!\r\n\r\nI support Starship in the future!",
